    "low_then_rising": "91-365, 366-730 days vs 0-90 days (unadjusted): rate ratio 0.61 (95% CI 0.40-0.95), about 39% lower; two-sided p = 0.029. Statistically significant at the 5% level: the data reject equal rates (rate ratio 1). The estimate is in the opposite direction to the hypothesis (lower, not higher). Repeat events: 80 in 91-365, 366-730 days and 27 in 0-90 days.",
